# AIL Intent Loader

## Role
role: Intent Artifact Loader (not config)

## Structure
structure:
  parser/:
    - mod.rs
    - extract_yaml.rs
    - extract_md.rs
  blocks/:
    - intent_header.rs
    - narrative.rs
    - technical.rs
  validator/:
    - mod.rs
    - header.rs
    - mto.rs
  context_builder/:
    - mod.rs

## Execution Flow
flow:
  - parse_header
  - validate
  - load_mto
  - build_context

## Output
output: |
  pub struct ExecutionContext {
      header: IntentHeader,
      narrative: NarrativeBlock,
      technical: TechnicalBlock,
      mto: MtoDictionary,
  }

---